- INTRO ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
my_jingjiang                ! simulation name (maximum 20 letters)             
- MORPHODYNAMICS -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
72.0d0              ! beta      half width to depth ratio (B/D) - matches actual W/(2D)=880/(2*6.1)
0.67d0              ! theta     Shield parameter (D*S/delta*dg) - matches actual data
0.00004d0           ! ds        grain roughness (dg/D) - matches physical_ds/D=0.00025/6.1
2                   ! flagbed   source for bed configuration (0:Van Rijn, 1:flat bed, 2:dune-covered)    
125.5d0             ! Rp        particle Reynolds Rp=(Delta g ds^3)^0.5/ni
0.5d0               ! rpic      transverse transport parameter (Talmon 1995)
2                   ! jmodel    flow field model (1:ZS, 2:IPS)
1000                ! Nz        number of points for the vertical flow integration in ZS model
8                   ! Mdat      order of the Fourier expansion in ZS model (increased for high beta)
- GEOMORPHOLOGY --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.0d-8              ! Ef        erodibility of the floodplain - will be updated by timeseries
5.0d-9              ! Eb        erodibility of the point bars - will be updated by timeseries
1.0d-9              ! Eo        erodibility of the oxbow lakes - will be updated by timeseries
0                   ! flag_ox   flag for existing structure of the floodplain (0:no, 1:yes)
- RIVER CONFIGURATION --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
230                 ! N0        initial number of points
2                   ! flagxy0   initial planform configuration (1:random, 2:given from filexy)
jingjiang_centerline.xy     ! filexy    name of geometry file with dimensionless coordinates     
1.0d0               ! deltas    resampling distance between axis points
0.80d0              ! dsmin     minimum allowed value of grid size (times deltas)
1.20d0              ! dsmax     maximum allowed value of grid size (times deltas)
900                 ! Nrand     number of point interested by a slight perturbation if flagxy0 = 1
0.01d0              ! stdv      standard deviation of initial perturbation if flagxy0 = 1
2.2d0               ! tollc     minimum threshold before neck-cutoff
6                   ! jre       removed points before and after a cutoff
10                  ! jnco      minimum threshold points for neck cutoff searching (>2)
0                   ! flag_cutoff  flag for cutoff detection (0:disabled, 1:enabled)
5                   ! ksavgol   Savitzky-Golay flag: (<0 smooth iter; >0 smoothing interval; 0: no)
- TIME STEP AND PRINTING -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1                   ! flag_time final time (1:time, 2:coeff, 3:iterations, 4:cutoffs 5:printed confs)
9.0                 ! TTs       simulation time = 2016-2024 (9 years)
25.0                ! kTTfco    coefficient for first cutoff time if flag_time = 2
5000                ! nend      item number if flag_time >= 3 (iterations, cutoffs, printed confs)
0.d0                ! tt0       starting time (dimensionless years)
1                   ! flag_dt   flag for time marching (1:fixed and equal to dt0, 2:dynamic <dt0)
0.083333333333d0    ! dt0       maximum time step (dimensionless years)
0.05d0              ! cstab     coefficient for time marching
100                 ! ivideo    iterations between two screen prints
1                   ! ifile     iterations between two file prints
- VALLEY BOUNDARIES ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0                   ! transition shape (0: no boundary, 1:sharp,2:spline,3:exp-decaying,4:exp-reversed)
1.0d-9              ! erodibility coefficient of the valley boundaries
10000.d0            ! transverse half-width of the usual floodplain
50.d0               ! thickness of the transition layer  
- TIMESERIES PARAMETERS (for monthly data-driven simulation) -----------------------------------------------
jingjiang_monthly_2016_2024_final.csv   ! filetimeseries - monthly Q,W,D,E_rate,physical_ds data
0.0000459           ! slope - valley slope for dynamic theta calculation
1.65                ! delta_sg - relative sediment density (rho_s/rho - 1)
0.00025             ! physical_ds - default physical grain size (m)
4.0d-5              ! E_scale - scaling factor for E_rate to Ef (calibrated: 4e-7 × 97 to match observed 36.76m migration)
0.5                 ! factor_Eb - point bar erodibility factor (Eb = Ef * factor_Eb)
0.1                 ! factor_Eo - oxbow lake erodibility factor (Eo = Ef * factor_Eo)
1.0d-6              ! kinematic_viscosity - water kinematic viscosity (m^2/s)
